<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 15:23:25 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>亿万富翁的妻子即将继承 6.6 万亿美元巨额财富转移中的很大一部分，到 2035 年，将有 1,235 名女性从中获利</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/wives-gen-xers-become-biggest-inheritors-in-6-6-trillion-transfer-billionaire-wealth-2035/</link><description>3,795 名亿万富翁将把他们的财富传给配偶、孩子和兄弟姐妹，而妻子们将大赚一笔。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2244936202-e1788446494661.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:59:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/wives-gen-xers-become-biggest-inheritors-in-6-6-trillion-transfer-billionaire-wealth-2035/</guid></item><item><title>为女性平等奋斗数十年的格洛丽亚·斯泰纳姆 (Gloria Steinem) 去世，享年 92 岁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/feminist-icon-gloria-dies-92/</link><description>这位《女士杂志》联合创始人成为六十年来妇女运动最有影响力的声音之一&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26246398405243-e1788446049929.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:38:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/feminist-icon-gloria-dies-92/</guid></item><item><title>债券市场正在摧毁特朗普的中期竞选</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/bond-yields-midterms-trump-10-year/</link><description>乔治华盛顿大学的斯蒂芬·卡普兰表示，债券市场正在向华盛顿发出“支票”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2250795897-1-e1788445511813.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:30:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/bond-yields-midterms-trump-10-year/</guid></item><item><title>亿万富翁莱昂·布莱克起诉国会“钓鱼”他与爱泼斯坦的关系</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/billionaire-leon-black-epstein-investigation/</link><description>司法部的爱泼斯坦档案中多次提到布莱克，他是调查中出现的众多有影响力的人物之一&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26246480870989-e1788445413664.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:25:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/billionaire-leon-black-epstein-investigation/</guid></item><item><title>穆迪可持续金融主管：亚洲正在拥抱能源“务实转型”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/energy-security-reshapes-asias-green-transition-moodys/</link><description>随着亚洲追求可再生能源、核电、替代燃料和煤炭，“美德信号”正在让位于国家能源优先事项。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Headshot-Rahul-Ghosh-e1788347558346.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 04:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/energy-security-reshapes-asias-green-transition-moodys/</guid></item><item><title>尽管实现两位数增长，Uber仍裁员3,300人，为机器人出租车的未来腾出空间</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/uber-job-cut-robotaxi-future/</link><description>首席执行官达拉·科斯罗萨西 (Dara Khosrowshahi) 表示，随着 Uber 向自动驾驶汽车投资数十亿美元，此次裁员将使 Uber “更快、更智能” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2252112682-e1788442513280.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 14:05:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/uber-job-cut-robotaxi-future/</guid></item><item><title>欧洲不需要任何增长方面的教训。 9 月 16 日，我们将揭晓 500 个原因</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/september-16-fortune-ceo-forum-500-uk/</link><description>9 月 16 日，我们将公布年度《财富》欧洲 500 强榜单，来自欧洲和中东各地的高管领导人将齐聚伦敦参加 FCF，讨论增长并分享成功经验和最佳实践。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1500530995-e1788443284480.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 12:28:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/september-16-fortune-ceo-forum-500-uk/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 9 月 2 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-02-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Price-of-Oil-Sep-2.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 12:00:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-02-2026/</guid></item><item><title>现在要进入 Anthropic，你至少需要 2500 万美元。对于 OpenAI 来说，它接近 100 万美元。</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/anthropic-need-at-least-25-million-openai-closer-to-1-million/</link><description>在二级市场上，对 Anthropic 股票的需求远高于 OpenAI。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2280291162-e1787668428608.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 11:52:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/anthropic-need-at-least-25-million-openai-closer-to-1-million/</guid></item><item><title>Charter CFO 转投 Blackstone-Google AI 合资企业标志着财务人才的流动</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/charter-cfo-move-to-blackstone-google-ai-venture-signals-where-finance-talent-flowing/</link><description>费舍尔在 Charter 工作了近十年后退出，标志着他将赌注押在人工智能基础设施上，而不是传统电缆上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Jessica-Fischer_HS_01.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 12:25:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/03/charter-cfo-move-to-blackstone-google-ai-venture-signals-where-finance-talent-flowing/</guid></item></channel></rss>